WEBVTT

00:04.140 --> 00:07.050
We have a bit of time before your 
appointment with the principal.

00:07.050 --> 00:08.650
Did you want to stop anywhere?

00:08.650 --> 00:09.680
It's fine.

00:09.680 --> 00:11.900
I'll show up early for a change.

00:16.230 --> 00:16.930
Stop the car.

00:16.930 --> 00:18.660
Huh? Right here?

00:19.340 --> 00:20.730
Go on ahead.

00:20.730 --> 00:23.840
Huh? A-Are you testing me?

00:23.840 --> 00:26.280
You're not going to hit me if 
I actually go on ahead, are you?

00:26.280 --> 00:28.150
Just what do you think I am?

00:28.830 --> 00:29.680
In that case...

00:38.540 --> 00:39.540
Now...

00:47.660 --> 00:50.040
Who are you?

01:15.880 --> 01:19.570
That was easier than I expected.

01:25.980 --> 01:27.220
Who are you...

01:29.350 --> 01:31.140
calling easy?

01:32.900 --> 01:34.700
Brat.

01:35.610 --> 01:39.000
He's a cursed spirit, but he 
can communicate clearly.

01:40.530 --> 01:42.880
And the sheer amount of cursed energy...

01:43.610 --> 01:45.770
An unregistered special-grade?

01:47.350 --> 01:49.950
He's likely stronger than Sukuna currently is.

01:51.430 --> 01:55.190
Special-grades are classified 
as such because they're special.

01:55.190 --> 01:58.810
Having them pop up this frequently 
throws everything off.

02:00.730 --> 02:02.720
Did I wound your pride?

02:03.580 --> 02:04.490
Nope.

02:05.690 --> 02:07.700
I'm starting to find this fun.

02:20.030 --> 02:26.990
Jujutsu Kaisen

03:41.630 --> 03:47.640
Episode 7:  Assault

03:41.630 --> 03:47.640
Episode 7:  Assault

03:41.730 --> 03:44.760
Finding this fun, you say?

03:45.020 --> 03:48.260
No sense of danger at all.

03:48.740 --> 03:51.720
He chose a place devoid of people?

03:52.880 --> 03:58.090
No, he was avoiding other 
sorcerers coming to back me up.

03:58.710 --> 04:00.010
Ember Insects!

04:01.140 --> 04:04.440
Well, if you're coming 
after me, you're right...

04:04.440 --> 04:06.350
about having no sense of danger.

04:11.320 --> 04:14.060
What happens if this hits me?

04:19.020 --> 04:19.860
Sound?

04:26.370 --> 04:28.930
A two-stage attack of sound and explosions?

04:29.380 --> 04:30.990
That's clever.

04:37.310 --> 04:39.190
There's more!

04:46.320 --> 04:48.120
That's all it took?

04:48.120 --> 04:51.840
I took a look for myself, and it was 
just an overestimation by the weak.

04:51.840 --> 04:55.070
That human was just as fragile as the rest.

04:55.480 --> 05:00.530
He wasn't living a life of truth. 
It's all so nauseatingly repulsive.

05:00.900 --> 05:06.420
I'm going to go spread real strength, 
the truth, through death.

05:06.900 --> 05:10.180
We just went over this a moment ago.

05:10.790 --> 05:12.960
Can't you even learn? Ugh, this smoke...

05:16.170 --> 05:17.920
What's the meaning of this?

05:19.210 --> 05:21.900
To put it simply, you didn't hit me.

05:21.900 --> 05:24.820
Impossible. That wasn't like before.

05:24.820 --> 05:27.350
I know I touched you and killed you.

05:27.610 --> 05:32.350
You touched the "Infinity" that 
exists between you and me.

05:33.440 --> 05:34.850
I'll show you.

05:35.410 --> 05:36.870
Put your hand out.

05:38.800 --> 05:40.360
Come on, come on.

05:41.850 --> 05:43.850
Come on, come on, come on.

05:44.640 --> 05:48.480
No hostility? I guess I'll see what it's about.

05:55.890 --> 05:56.640
See?

05:58.690 --> 06:00.400
I can't touch him?

06:00.400 --> 06:01.970
It stops just before him.

06:02.630 --> 06:04.930
This is Infinity?

06:05.250 --> 06:09.920
You're not exactly stopped, 
but the closer you get, the slower you go.

06:10.610 --> 06:12.400
So, what now?

06:12.650 --> 06:16.360
We could just shake 
hands like this, you know.

06:17.360 --> 06:18.860
I refuse.

06:19.220 --> 06:20.860
Don't be shy, now.

06:21.270 --> 06:23.540
You're making me embarrassed, too.

06:25.230 --> 06:26.780
Damn you!

06:31.800 --> 06:32.890
He's fast!

06:32.890 --> 06:35.810
It's not just a blow 
strengthened by cursed energy!

06:36.300 --> 06:37.620
What is this?!

06:37.620 --> 06:38.730
I don't get it!

06:38.730 --> 06:40.050
I have to know!

06:40.280 --> 06:41.450
There's still more!

06:47.010 --> 06:50.460
Infinity exists everywhere.

06:51.420 --> 06:54.960
My jujutsu just brings it forward in reality.

06:55.630 --> 06:57.840
Convergence, divergence...

06:58.320 --> 07:00.980
What do you think happens 
when one touchs this void?

07:02.180 --> 07:04.900
Cursed Technique Reversal: Red.

07:50.920 --> 07:52.420
Oh, this is perfect.

07:55.340 --> 07:56.660
You can try,

07:57.640 --> 08:00.180
but you'll die, Jougo.

08:07.280 --> 08:10.390
It wasn't just talk.

08:12.700 --> 08:17.480
No matter. If I can't hit him, 
I'll just drag him into my Domain.

08:19.640 --> 08:20.980
Where did he go?

08:22.230 --> 08:23.600
Sorry about that.

08:24.350 --> 08:26.880
Where the heck?! Hey, where are we?!

08:27.460 --> 08:28.640
Were you waiting?

08:29.520 --> 08:30.990
That's...

08:30.990 --> 08:32.700
Sukuna's vessel?!

08:33.060 --> 08:35.900
This is Itadori Yuuji-kun, 
and he's here to watch.

08:35.900 --> 08:38.160
Mt. Fuji! His head's Mt. Fuji!

08:46.510 --> 08:48.470
I'll protect you.

08:48.960 --> 08:50.430
I'll never leave you.

08:51.600 --> 08:52.620
Sam...

08:58.310 --> 09:02.320
Wow, he learns surprisingly quick.

09:02.850 --> 09:03.900
Come on.

09:03.900 --> 09:04.610
Yuuji.

09:06.750 --> 09:08.230
Gojou-sensei?

09:08.750 --> 09:11.240
Talking to him doesn't 
cause a problem, either.

09:11.490 --> 09:12.800
You need something?

09:12.800 --> 09:16.700
Looks like we'll be able to increase his output 
quickly and move on to the next stage soon.

09:16.960 --> 09:18.630
We're heading out, Yuuji.

09:18.630 --> 09:19.460
Huh?

09:19.740 --> 09:21.090
It's an extracurricular lesson.

09:21.480 --> 09:27.190
I'm going to teach you about the pinnacle 
of jujutsu battles, Domain Expansion.

09:31.760 --> 09:34.880
Why aren't we sinking?!

09:35.130 --> 09:39.660
Sensei, I was at the school 
just ten seconds ago, right?

09:39.660 --> 09:40.810
What's going on here?

09:40.810 --> 09:42.160
Oh, we warped here.

09:42.160 --> 09:44.320
He has no intention of explaining.

09:43.370 --> 09:45.060
Sukuna's vessel...

09:45.070 --> 09:47.140
So he really is alive.

09:47.840 --> 09:50.830
You have to render Gojou 
Satoru incapable of fighting.

09:51.870 --> 09:55.970
The second is to get Ryoumen Sukuna 
and Itadori Yuuji on your side.

09:58.480 --> 10:01.390
I can't kill Itadori due to our future plans...

10:01.390 --> 10:04.550
Has he caught on to our goals?

10:05.060 --> 10:07.440
What's the brat for? He a shield?

10:07.440 --> 10:09.610
A shield? No, no.

10:09.610 --> 10:11.920
I told you, he's here to watch.

10:12.340 --> 10:15.460
I'm in the middle of teaching 
this boy lots of things.

10:15.920 --> 10:18.550
Don't worry about him. Just keep fighting.

10:19.280 --> 10:23.920
Bringing in someone who will slow 
you down just makes you a fool.

10:25.260 --> 10:28.360
It'll be fine. After all...

10:28.560 --> 10:30.150
you're weak.

10:35.420 --> 10:37.870
Don't underestimate me, brat!

10:37.870 --> 10:41.610
I'm going to enjoy swallowing 
up that smug face of yours!

10:47.800 --> 10:49.200
This guy...

10:49.830 --> 10:51.310
is weak?

10:53.610 --> 10:58.910
He's way more monstrous than any of 
the monsters I've encountered so far!

11:04.000 --> 11:05.290
You'll be fine.

11:05.700 --> 11:07.730
Just stay close to me.

11:11.600 --> 11:13.970
Domain Expansion!

11:38.230 --> 11:41.740
Wh-What is this?!

11:42.810 --> 11:45.200
Coffin of the Iron Mountain!

11:48.140 --> 11:50.930
Jujutsu Kaisen

11:53.600 --> 11:55.940
Jujutsu Kaisen

12:02.300 --> 12:04.670
Wh-What is this?!

12:05.410 --> 12:07.260
This is Domain Expansion.

12:08.930 --> 12:11.730
You use cursed energy to 
construct an Innate Domain

12:10.130 --> 12:11.060
Ow, hot!

12:11.060 --> 12:11.830
Hot, hot, hot!

12:11.730 --> 12:14.030
imbued with a cursed technique 
in your surroundings.

12:11.830 --> 12:13.980
Hot, hot, hot, hot, hot!

12:16.700 --> 12:18.960
What you all experienced at 
the juvenile detention center

12:18.960 --> 12:22.430
was an incomplete Domain that hadn't 
been imbued with any cursed techniques.

12:22.960 --> 12:26.280
If that had been a proper Domain, 
all of you first-years would have died.

12:26.790 --> 12:28.560
I think Megumi understood that.

12:30.080 --> 12:34.250
Spreading out a Domain 
consumes a ton of energy,

12:34.250 --> 12:36.410
but its merits are worth the cost.

12:36.410 --> 12:40.080
One such benefit is the boost to 
stats due to environmental factors.

12:40.080 --> 12:40.810
Oh!

12:41.170 --> 12:43.730
Like buffs in video games!

12:44.650 --> 12:46.240
Another is...

12:49.650 --> 12:54.750
Most sorcerers would have burned to ash 
the moment they entered my Domain!

12:55.400 --> 13:00.800
...that the techniques imbued in the Domain 
are guaranteed to hit within that Domain.

13:01.230 --> 13:02.390
Guaranteed?!

13:02.390 --> 13:03.760
Guaranteed.

13:04.400 --> 13:07.440
But don't worry. There are 
several ways to deal with it.

13:10.000 --> 13:12.770
You can take the hit using a 
cursed technique, like just now, or...

13:13.710 --> 13:15.840
I don't really recommend this one,

13:16.640 --> 13:19.910
but you can go outside the Domain. 
That's usually impossible.

13:20.160 --> 13:21.180
You can also...

13:21.180 --> 13:25.550
If I neutralize that Infinity 
of yours with a dense Domain,

13:25.550 --> 13:27.610
then my techniques will reach you.

13:27.880 --> 13:29.370
Yeah, they'll hit.

13:29.370 --> 13:30.370
Huh? Infinity?

13:31.200 --> 13:33.420
Give me the Prison Realm!

13:34.330 --> 13:36.190
I'll add it to my collection.

13:37.200 --> 13:40.750
I came here half in jest.

13:41.240 --> 13:45.130
I thought I wouldn't care if I couldn't kill him.

13:45.540 --> 13:48.680
But having this difference 
between us thrust in my face...

13:49.120 --> 13:50.760
On my pride as a cursed spirit,

13:50.760 --> 13:56.070
as the new humanity, 
this is completely unacceptable!

13:56.890 --> 13:59.990
The most effective way to deal with a Domain

14:00.470 --> 14:02.830
is to lay out your own Domain.

14:02.830 --> 14:05.580
When two Domains are 
laid out at the same time,

14:05.850 --> 14:09.590
the more refined one 
will dominate that space.

14:09.910 --> 14:13.580
Though, sometimes, compatibility and 
the amount of cursed energy are factors.

14:14.260 --> 14:19.040
There won't even be ashes 
left of you, Gojou Satoru!

14:25.420 --> 14:27.140
Domain Expansion:

14:30.210 --> 14:32.100
Infinite Void.

14:56.450 --> 14:58.310
What just happened?

14:59.050 --> 15:02.470
Was my Domain overwhelmed?

15:03.260 --> 15:04.790
I can't see anything.

15:04.790 --> 15:06.230
I can't feel anything.

15:07.530 --> 15:09.240
No...

15:09.240 --> 15:11.570
I can see everything!

15:11.570 --> 15:12.880
I can feel everything!

15:12.880 --> 15:15.910
But the information is never complete...

15:16.810 --> 15:20.650
So I can't do anything!

15:22.270 --> 15:25.070
This is the inner world of Limitless.

15:25.880 --> 15:28.150
Perception, communication...

15:28.670 --> 15:33.460
Every action involved in living is forcibly 
carried out an infinite number of times.

15:34.980 --> 15:36.730
It's ironic, isn't it?

15:36.730 --> 15:40.480
When granted everything, 
you can't do anything...

15:40.700 --> 15:42.960
but just die peacefully.

15:43.460 --> 15:46.430
But I have questions I want to ask you,

15:46.430 --> 15:49.860
so I'm letting you off the hook with this.

16:04.990 --> 16:09.730
Now, who told you to come after me?

16:10.110 --> 16:12.960
He really is the strongest jujutsu sorcerer!

16:13.450 --> 16:14.740
As a living organism,

16:15.500 --> 16:17.090
he's on another level!

16:20.430 --> 16:21.710
Oh, dear.

16:22.820 --> 16:24.000
What now?

16:24.490 --> 16:25.650
Will you rescue him?

16:26.890 --> 16:33.370
I can't let people from the school see 
my face, so I'll be going home now.

16:35.340 --> 16:38.410
If you want to save him, 
go ahead and save him.

16:38.980 --> 16:42.670
Though I don't know if your 
kind have such emotions.

16:43.210 --> 16:47.520
We do. We're the true humans, after all.

16:49.590 --> 16:53.210
Quite the statement for 
a cursed spirit to make.

16:54.240 --> 16:57.390
You don't seem like the type to act on orders.

16:58.040 --> 17:02.850
Was something good supposed 
to happen if you killed me?

17:03.140 --> 17:06.080
Regardless, I want to know. Who was it?

17:06.430 --> 17:09.190
Come on, just tell me already.

17:10.020 --> 17:13.050
Like I'd ever tell you, brat!

17:13.360 --> 17:16.760
You sure you should be saying that?

17:17.550 --> 17:19.050
Damn you!

17:19.360 --> 17:22.480
Hurry up and tell me, or I'll exorcise you.

17:22.480 --> 17:24.080
Of course, I'll do that either way.

17:24.080 --> 17:27.530
Wait, curses are capable 
of holding conversations?

17:27.530 --> 17:29.680
It seemed so normal, I overlooked it.

17:37.490 --> 17:38.470
Wow!

17:38.470 --> 17:39.230
Flowers!

17:39.230 --> 17:40.160
Pretty!

17:43.420 --> 17:46.800
That is a curse, right? 
It's stripping away my will to fight.

17:53.440 --> 17:55.780
Sensei, I'll be fine!

17:55.780 --> 17:57.910
Go after him!

17:59.490 --> 18:01.230
Sorry, I lied! Help!

18:06.840 --> 18:08.030
Wow.

18:08.500 --> 18:09.790
He got away.

18:10.110 --> 18:12.030
He's good at hiding his presence.

18:12.760 --> 18:16.250
He's way creepier than Volcano Head.

18:19.860 --> 18:26.250
I'm sorry about that.
They managed to escape because of me.
Though you're the one who brought me here, right?
- Yuuji

18:19.930 --> 18:21.450
I'm sorry about that.

18:21.120 --> 18:24.420
So cursed spirits of that level 
are forming a faction now?

18:21.450 --> 18:23.950
They managed to escape because of me.

18:23.950 --> 18:26.250
Though you're the one 
who brought me here, right?

18:24.420 --> 18:26.260
This is getting interesting.

18:26.740 --> 18:27.780
Yuuji.

18:27.780 --> 18:32.620
I want you—or rather, everyone—
to become strong enough to beat that.

18:33.210 --> 18:35.180
Huh? Beat that?

18:35.440 --> 18:38.020
It's better to have a concrete goal, right?

18:38.020 --> 18:41.010
Man, I'm glad brought you here.

18:41.010 --> 18:43.960
I had no idea what was going on, though.

18:43.960 --> 18:45.200
Are you serious?

18:45.200 --> 18:49.500
Now that we've set your goal, 
all that's left is to pursue it.

18:49.760 --> 18:51.610
We'll speed up the schedule a bit.

18:51.610 --> 18:56.200
For the next month, you'll be 
watching movies and fighting me.

18:56.200 --> 18:57.630
Fighting you?!

18:58.960 --> 19:01.720
Will I still be alive a month from now?

19:01.720 --> 19:03.810
After that, it's practical combat.

19:03.810 --> 19:06.580
You'll take on and complete 
several harder missions.

19:06.580 --> 19:09.070
You'll learn the basics 
and how to apply them,

19:09.070 --> 19:12.690
and then you'll show them off 
at the exchange event.

19:12.690 --> 19:14.000
Hey, Sensei!

19:14.000 --> 19:15.630
Yes, Yuuji-kun?

19:15.840 --> 19:18.630
What's the exchange event?

19:20.370 --> 19:21.770
I didn't tell you?

19:30.070 --> 19:31.320
He's late!

19:59.840 --> 20:01.800
Sure is peaceful here.

20:05.760 --> 20:08.250
How's Jougo doing, Getou?

20:09.180 --> 20:10.500
On death's door.

20:11.010 --> 20:13.040
Hanami stepped in to save him,

20:13.040 --> 20:14.720
so he'll probably be fine.

20:15.020 --> 20:16.740
How irresponsible.

20:16.740 --> 20:18.450
You're the one who egged him on.

20:18.810 --> 20:20.390
Heavens, no.

20:20.390 --> 20:22.080
I tried to stop him.

20:26.210 --> 20:27.660
Speak of the devil.

20:28.070 --> 20:29.890
Jougo, Hanami.

20:30.320 --> 20:32.910
Glad to see you're safe.

20:33.170 --> 20:35.930
How can you say that when you see me like this?!

20:37.020 --> 20:39.180
You're lucky you got off with just that.

20:41.390 --> 20:43.440
Why, you...

20:43.440 --> 20:44.890
I think you understand now...

20:45.660 --> 20:49.270
So we'll go about sealing Gojou Satoru 
at the appropriate time,

20:49.270 --> 20:53.380
in the appropriate place, once we've secured our advantage over him.

20:53.910 --> 20:57.010
We'll carry it out on October 31st in Shibuya.

20:57.440 --> 20:59.410
I'll contact you with more details later.

21:00.380 --> 21:02.320
Good enough, Mahito?

21:02.320 --> 21:03.530
Cloud Giant

21:04.830 --> 21:06.160
No objections here.

21:06.930 --> 21:08.250
Let's be cunning about this.

21:09.020 --> 21:10.240
Like curses should.

21:11.030 --> 21:12.320
Like humans should.

22:44.920 --> 22:47.470
Juju Stroll

22:47.470 --> 22:51.080
One, two, three, four...

22:51.080 --> 22:52.450
What are you doing?

22:52.450 --> 22:53.610
Brazilian calisthenics.

22:53.610 --> 22:54.480
Three, four...

22:54.780 --> 22:56.900
I think we're nice and warmed up now.

22:56.900 --> 22:57.890
Yeah.

22:59.810 --> 23:02.280
What are you two planning to do?

23:12.770 --> 23:13.750
Getou-kun!

23:14.650 --> 23:15.570
Shoot!

23:21.300 --> 23:22.400
Mahito-kun!

23:26.900 --> 23:29.540
Overhead!

23:29.940 --> 23:31.610
Shoot!

23:41.740 --> 23:44.710
I'm gonna kill these two later!

23:44.940 --> 23:46.270
Tokyo Metropolitan
Jujutsu Technical High School

23:51.530 --> 23:54.950
Episode 8:
Boredom
